fetch core co @sharded 0 @conveyor
sensor surgn co @silicon
set snn surgn
sensor surg co @surge-alloy
set sn surg
sensor th co @phase-fabric
set thn th
sensor thk co @thorium
set thnn thk
jump 30 greaterThan @second 950
set thnn thk
sensor thk co @thorium
op sub dthh thk thnn
jump 27 greaterThan dthh 540
set thn th
sensor th co @phase-fabric
op sub dth th thn
jump 27 greaterThan dth 300
set sn surg
sensor surg co @surge-alloy
op sub dsurg surg sn
jump 27 greaterThan dsurg 300
set snn surgn
sensor surgn co @silicon
op sub dsurgn surgn snn
jump 27 greaterThan dsurgn 1800
jump 31 always th 200
spawn @crawler 292 280 90 @crux result
setrule waveSpacing 50 0 0 100 100
set klop 7164
stop
wait 5
setprop @surge-alloy nucleus1 123
setprop @blast-compound nucleus1 123
setprop @phase-fabric nucleus1 123
setprop @thorium nucleus1 1234
setprop @titanium nucleus1 1234
setprop @silicon nucleus1 1234
jump 9 always th 200
